OL,3,GNEWSA'Carnival is more like a lifestyle
OL,4,Athan just a hobby'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs you drive into one of Somerset's
OL,7,Fhistoric market towns you are greeted
OL,8,Fby the sign "Bridgwater: Home of
OL,9,FCarnival".
OL,11,FFor many, the town's name is almost
OL,12,Fsynonymous with the fantastical Guy
OL,13,FFawkes Carnival they hold.
OL,15,FIt is the oldest and one of the largest
OL,16,Fcarnivals in the country, with
OL,17,Fgenerations of Somerset families
OL,18,Fdedicating huge amounts of their time,
OL,19,Fenergy and resources into creating
OL,20,Fwonderful and imaginative carts, or
OL,21,Ffloats.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
