OL,3,GNEWSA'Carnival is more like a lifestyle
OL,4,Athan just a hobby'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMany different carnival clubs work on
OL,7,Fcreating the different carts, each with
OL,8,Fa different theme, which are taken to
OL,9,Fprocessions around the towns and
OL,10,Fvillages of Somerset through the autumn
OL,11,Fmonths.
